WEBVTT

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:19.680
Human festivals aren't bad, huh, John?

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:21.770
Don't get too excited, idiot.
We're working!

00:00:21.770 --> 00:00:23.480
Yeah, Draluc.

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:26.400
Come on, loosen up.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:29.230
Hinaichi, you have a cute yukata on, too.

00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:33.780
Cute? I'm just undercover!
My uniform would stand out.

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:36.570
If there are any vampires
causing trouble at the festival,

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:39.410
then we have to catch them...

00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:40.660
"Festive Festival"

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:43.370
"Festive Festival"

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:43.370
It's a hunter's job to protect
the festival from those guys.

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:44.710
It's a hunter's job to protect
the festival from those guys.

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:46.830
Don't get so excited that you miss them!

00:00:46.830 --> 00:00:50.250
Wow, you're like the god
of non-persuasiveness.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:53.670
Anyway, let's patrol while paying
attention to our surroundings.

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:57.090
"Nudenium"
"Freshly bloomed!!"
"They can walk"

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:58.850
Welcome.

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:33.650
--Nude, nude, nude,
nude, nude, nude...

00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:35.190
"The Festival Music Calls You"

00:02:33.650 --> 00:02:35.190
--Nude, nude, nude,
nude, nude, nude...

00:02:35.190 --> 00:02:37.280
"The Festival Music Calls You"

00:02:35.190 --> 00:02:37.280
--Nude, nude, nude,
nude, nude, nude...
--Welcome!

00:02:37.280 --> 00:02:38.860
"The Festival Music Calls You"

00:02:37.280 --> 00:02:38.860
Welcome!

00:02:38.860 --> 00:02:41.070
Welcom--

00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:42.910
What are you doing?!

00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:46.040
I'm just selling geraniums in the nude.

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:49.410
Why do you think you're
allowed to do that, idiot?!

00:02:49.410 --> 00:02:51.750
Man, we got a vampire booth
right from the start!

00:02:51.750 --> 00:02:54.880
If that's the case, we need to go
around the whole festival first.

00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:57.710
Hey, wait. I'll also--

00:02:57.710 --> 00:02:59.170
Draluc, hurry up and come along.

00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:02.550
--Draluc!
--Sand...
--Nude, nude, nude...

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:06.350
You can't sell inferior vampires here!

00:03:06.350 --> 00:03:08.270
Baby Nudeniums...

00:03:08.270 --> 00:03:11.100
Shoot, we've gotten
separated from Ronaldo.

00:03:11.100 --> 00:03:12.980
That guy's so impatient...

00:03:12.980 --> 00:03:16.440
Don't worry about it.
We can patrol separately, too.

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:19.740
That's true, but you're not the one
who should be saying that.

00:03:21.490 --> 00:03:24.030
Don't die from getting jostled
by the crowd, Draluc.

00:03:24.030 --> 00:03:27.330
You die easily, so don't act carelessly--

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:29.790
Mister! I want one turn at the ball toss.

00:03:29.790 --> 00:03:31.960
What did I just say?!

00:03:35.420 --> 00:03:36.840
John!

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:39.800
Listen when I talk! Wee-wee!
Don't just go off and play! Wee-wee!

00:03:39.800 --> 00:03:42.720
It's fine. It <i>is </i>a festival, after all.

00:03:42.720 --> 00:03:45.430
What are you going to do
if a vampire attacks?

00:03:46.350 --> 00:03:50.310
I'm the vampire lord, Draluc.

00:03:50.310 --> 00:03:53.810
I am not afraid of other
inferior vampires!

00:03:54.730 --> 00:03:57.360
Excuse me, one turn
at the ring toss, please.

00:03:58.360 --> 00:04:00.650
That'll be 300 yen.

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:06.620
You miss.

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:08.870
Sand!

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:11.580
Draluc!

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:13.290
You're under arrest! You're under arrest!

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:14.710
I'm gonna hunt you down!

00:04:14.710 --> 00:04:16.420
Come quietly!

00:04:16.420 --> 00:04:17.630
My perfect plan

00:04:17.630 --> 00:04:22.260
to become part of the ring toss game and
suck the blood of handsome men is ruined!

00:04:22.260 --> 00:04:24.470
Jeez. Be careful, Dralu--

00:04:24.470 --> 00:04:26.090
Mister, please give me a scoop.

00:04:26.090 --> 00:04:27.510
Don't you ever learn?!

00:04:27.510 --> 00:04:28.850
Wee-wee...

00:04:28.850 --> 00:04:33.140
Now, now, let me show you
my magnificent technique.

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:40.570
Foolish compatriot,
hanging out with inferior humans...

00:04:40.570 --> 00:04:45.570
"Vampiric Telescope Goldfish"
Without even knowing that all humans
will become my servants.

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:54.580
Look forward to the coming day
of destruction as much as you can.

00:04:54.580 --> 00:04:57.210
Stop that.

00:04:57.210 --> 00:04:59.090
Why are there so many vampires here?

00:04:59.090 --> 00:05:01.210
Hey, Miss!

00:05:01.210 --> 00:05:05.300
If you beat me at rock-paper-scissors,
you get a free chocolate banana.

00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:06.720
Out! Safe!

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:08.510
♪ <i>Yoyoinoyoi! </i>♪

00:05:11.890 --> 00:05:12.930
Why are you stripping?!

00:05:12.930 --> 00:05:16.230
I'll put corn kernels
in the offertory box!

00:05:16.230 --> 00:05:18.230
They're appearing one after another!

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:19.560
"Stem Lottery"
"Prize"

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:19.560
Welcome!

00:05:19.560 --> 00:05:21.150
"Stem Lottery"
"Prize"

00:05:19.560 --> 00:05:21.150
You were already at another booth!

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:25.360
"Vampire - Cotton Candy Maker"
I'm no one suspicious!
No one suspicious at all!

00:05:25.360 --> 00:05:26.280
"Vampire - Cotton Candy Maker"
One please!

00:05:26.280 --> 00:05:28.530
Draluc, come on!

00:05:29.820 --> 00:05:32.660
Got you! I'll turn you into cotton candy!

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:34.750
Idiot!

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:39.080
I kind of understand why
Ronaldo kills you all the time.

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:42.590
Wahhh!

00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:46.630
Even so... There are too
many vampires here!

00:05:46.630 --> 00:05:48.970
Hunters and Vamp Control are nothing!

00:05:48.970 --> 00:05:50.260
I wanna drink blood!

00:05:50.260 --> 00:05:52.810
Handsome men!

00:05:52.810 --> 00:05:54.520
I can't deal with them in time!

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:56.810
♪ Alcohol and the hunt ♪

00:05:56.810 --> 00:05:59.980
♪ Are the festival's splendor ♪

00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:06.150
Stop that, my compatriots.

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:12.620
E-Empress!

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:16.790
It is boorish to defile
such a glorious festival.

00:06:16.790 --> 00:06:21.290
Let us stop fighting and get
along, at least for tonight.

00:06:21.290 --> 00:06:27.300
It's a festival. Humans and
vampires should all enjoy it.

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:29.590
Empress...

00:06:29.590 --> 00:06:31.970
It is as the empress says.

00:06:35.180 --> 00:06:37.310
Thanks for your help.

00:06:37.310 --> 00:06:37.810
"Shin-Yokohama-style <i>yakisoba </i>- 500 yen"

00:06:37.310 --> 00:06:37.810
Thanks for your help.

00:06:37.810 --> 00:06:39.980
"Shin-Yokohama-style <i>yakisoba </i>- 500 yen"

00:06:37.810 --> 00:06:39.980
It was nothing.

00:06:39.980 --> 00:06:44.520
Now, I'm going to enjoy the
festival, too, with Adamppi.

00:06:44.520 --> 00:06:49.030
Mister, please give me all the
<i>yakisoba </i>you have on hand.

00:06:49.030 --> 00:06:50.660
I'll have to close for the day!

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:52.370
H-Hey!

00:07:06.710 --> 00:07:10.340
Man... that was exhausting.

00:07:15.180 --> 00:07:18.390
There were booths over here, too?

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:40.710
Huh?

00:07:49.010 --> 00:07:51.550
Oh, Miss...

00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:55.430
Are you alone? You're a good girl...

00:07:56.640 --> 00:07:58.600
Come...

00:08:01.060 --> 00:08:03.810
Come closer...

00:08:06.940 --> 00:08:11.860
Who are you...?
Why do you get in my way...?

00:08:16.070 --> 00:08:17.870
Wait...

00:08:23.120 --> 00:08:24.670
Hinaichi!

00:08:26.460 --> 00:08:28.670
Why are you spacing out?

00:08:28.670 --> 00:08:30.090
Huh?

00:08:31.090 --> 00:08:35.390
Oh, I think I just had a strange dream...

00:08:35.390 --> 00:08:37.850
What, you were that tired?

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:39.220
The portable shrine parade is starting,

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:41.640
so why don't you watch that
and then go home early?

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:46.150
Hey, Draluc. Just now, in my dream...

00:08:46.150 --> 00:08:47.810
Hm?

00:08:47.810 --> 00:08:51.530
Oh... never mind...

00:08:51.530 --> 00:08:54.530
Oh, it's starting!

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:57.030
All right!

00:08:57.030 --> 00:08:59.370
This year, it's an empress shrine!

00:08:59.370 --> 00:09:00.990
Let's go, guys!

00:09:00.990 --> 00:09:04.210
Yeah! Ready, and--

00:09:22.180 --> 00:09:26.980
"Heisei Annoying Vampire
Battle in Shin-Yoko"

00:09:27.310 --> 00:09:29.020
You're late, hunter.

00:09:29.020 --> 00:09:32.110
No, I'm not! You're the one
who called me suddenly.

00:09:32.110 --> 00:09:33.940
Well? What do you want?

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:37.780
All right, fools.
First, look at these materials.

00:09:37.780 --> 00:09:43.290
This is an organism we ma--ahem--
captured for research purposes.

00:09:43.290 --> 00:09:44.870
It doesn't suck much blood,

00:09:44.870 --> 00:09:47.080
so there is little danger
in the organism itself.

00:09:47.080 --> 00:09:49.670
However, because it is parasitic

00:09:49.670 --> 00:09:53.000
and has abilities similar to
hypnosis or brainwashing,

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:56.130
it may have great influence
on human society.

00:09:56.130 --> 00:09:57.510
I let a thing like that loose.

00:09:57.510 --> 00:09:59.390
You idiot!

00:09:59.390 --> 00:10:04.720
No facility is completely secure,
and this was an inevitable accident.

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:06.270
It wasn't my fault.

00:10:07.310 --> 00:10:11.060
Hurry up and catch it.
You're so lucky to get this job.

00:10:11.060 --> 00:10:13.230
Hey, this is my first time meeting him,

00:10:13.230 --> 00:10:15.650
but what's with this living
embodiment of rudeness?

00:10:15.650 --> 00:10:18.320
He's the director of the VRC!

00:10:18.320 --> 00:10:21.990
He's a genius that everyone in the
field of vampire research knows.

00:10:21.990 --> 00:10:25.790
He's also the one who created the
medicine to treat pseudovampires.

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:27.460
But he prioritizes his own research

00:10:27.460 --> 00:10:29.420
above anything else and is always
making a mess of things.

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:32.090
He creates as much trouble
as he does good, huh?

00:10:32.090 --> 00:10:33.210
Quiet.

00:10:33.210 --> 00:10:36.550
I am a great genius, so I won't
get in trouble no matter what I do.

00:10:36.550 --> 00:10:38.220
Vampire Draluc.

00:10:38.220 --> 00:10:41.970
You will soon become a subject for
my research, too. Nice to meet you.

00:10:41.970 --> 00:10:43.970
No way. Nice to meet you.

00:10:43.970 --> 00:10:47.020
Well, what can you tell us
about the runaway vampire?

00:10:47.020 --> 00:10:48.810
Where do you think it would hide?

00:10:48.810 --> 00:10:52.900
How the hell am I supposed to know?
I'm returning to my research.

00:10:52.900 --> 00:10:55.110
Stop troubling this great geniu--

00:10:55.110 --> 00:10:57.400
--What did you say? What did you say?!
--I'll explain! I'll explain!

00:10:57.400 --> 00:11:00.570
Even a great genius
yields to violence, huh?

00:11:03.370 --> 00:11:07.540
Th-That vampiric bug gives off
strong attraction pheromones.

00:11:07.540 --> 00:11:08.620
Attraction?

00:11:08.620 --> 00:11:10.210
In other words,

00:11:10.210 --> 00:11:13.290
those who become its host become super
popular, especially with the opposite sex.

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:14.790
What? I want that!

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:17.800
If you see someone who wasn't popular
before become popular suddenly,

00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:19.470
then you've found its host.

00:11:19.470 --> 00:11:24.890
Also, it attaches at the abdomen,
so it looks like giant testicles.

00:11:24.890 --> 00:11:26.810
Never mind, I don't want that!

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:31.390
But to become popular in exchange for
an extra two hanging off your abdomen...

00:11:31.390 --> 00:11:33.020
It's an extreme decision.

00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:35.440
I don't think there's an idiot who
wants to be popular that badly.

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:37.320
Hey, Ronaldo, what a coincidence!

00:11:37.320 --> 00:11:38.280
Idiot!

00:11:38.280 --> 00:11:43.030
You've become the host of a vampiric bug!
That thing is what's attracting the girls!

00:11:43.030 --> 00:11:44.950
It's unseemly for a man to be jealous.

00:11:44.950 --> 00:11:48.040
He's like a warped <i>tanuki </i>statue.

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:55.130
Starting tonight, my style is the only
justice that will achieve love!

00:11:55.130 --> 00:11:57.710
Y-You're really okay with that?

00:11:57.710 --> 00:11:59.420
Shut up! I'll say it again!

00:11:59.420 --> 00:12:03.340
I'm starting to climb... the hill
to becoming popular with girls!

00:12:03.340 --> 00:12:05.050
Bubuo, you're so cool!

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:08.010
You smell wild!

00:12:08.010 --> 00:12:09.810
Why are you trying to act cool, moron?!

00:12:09.810 --> 00:12:13.020
Your hair smells like an unwashed dog.

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:14.560
Poor guy.

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:15.980
Oh, no. Let's go!

00:12:15.980 --> 00:12:19.230
Right. The next victim will also be fun!

00:12:19.230 --> 00:12:20.900
Refined, cute, and cool!

00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:23.820
A dandy who doesn't hide how it really is.

00:12:23.820 --> 00:12:27.450
My time... The generation has awakened!

00:12:27.450 --> 00:12:31.120
You too?! Idiot! Manager idiot!

00:12:31.120 --> 00:12:32.960
Dad...

00:12:32.960 --> 00:12:38.380
Bubuo, do you know why
you stopped being popular?

00:12:40.840 --> 00:12:44.180
You forgot your faith and love of girls--

00:12:44.180 --> 00:12:45.340
That's not it!

00:12:45.340 --> 00:12:48.430
If that's the case, you won't be
popular no matter what you do!

00:12:48.430 --> 00:12:50.640
Like you can lecture your son.

00:12:50.640 --> 00:12:53.270
A real-life middle-aged man
shouldn't get so excited.

00:12:53.270 --> 00:12:56.060
Don't create any more sad victims!

00:12:56.060 --> 00:12:57.400
There it is, Ronaldo!

00:12:57.400 --> 00:13:00.820
All right, check--

00:13:00.820 --> 00:13:03.950
Oh, dear, my nose slipped.

00:13:03.950 --> 00:13:05.740
Bastard!

00:13:05.740 --> 00:13:07.700
I've heard about what's going on.

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:11.120
If I just put this thing on,
the world will be my boob oyster!

00:13:11.120 --> 00:13:15.460
Stop that! You're already
a walking dirty joke!

00:13:15.460 --> 00:13:17.290
--So cute!
--Trumpet!

00:13:17.290 --> 00:13:18.040
--Am I in paradise?

00:13:18.040 --> 00:13:20.460
--Oh my, you're so cute!
--Am I in paradise?

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:23.380
Your skin is so supple.

00:13:24.510 --> 00:13:28.140
No...!

00:13:28.140 --> 00:13:29.890
Oh, he's cooled down!

00:13:29.890 --> 00:13:34.930
--Yer a shiny handsome man, aren't ya?
--Stop! The vampiric bug
isn't on me anymore!

00:13:34.930 --> 00:13:35.480
--Show us yer undies!
--Stop! The vampiric bug
isn't on me anymore!

00:13:35.480 --> 00:13:37.650
--Show us yer undies!
--Don't you think there are
more people gathering now?

00:13:37.650 --> 00:13:41.980
That vampiric bug's powers are growing.
We need to hurry up and catch it.

00:13:41.980 --> 00:13:44.240
Whoa, it's gotten faster!

00:13:46.700 --> 00:13:51.120
Damn it... It's hard to
survive on fish blood...

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:55.120
I might be better off swiping
some human food...

00:13:55.120 --> 00:14:01.840
Just thinking that means that I
must have already fallen very far...

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:04.550
Th-That's not true.

00:14:04.550 --> 00:14:07.550
Right now, I am just waiting
for my chance for vengeance.

00:14:07.550 --> 00:14:11.300
One of these days, I'll cut down
those hunters. And that ball--

00:14:11.810 --> 00:14:12.640
"Marriage Registration"

00:14:12.640 --> 00:14:14.890
"Marriage Registration"

00:14:12.640 --> 00:14:14.890
You've got a nice body, mister!

00:14:14.890 --> 00:14:16.770
Tokimeki tonight with me!

00:14:16.770 --> 00:14:19.310
Sex and the city!

00:14:26.900 --> 00:14:28.240
Wee-wee?

00:14:28.240 --> 00:14:31.200
You dare appear again, exhibitionist?!
Full-out public indecency!

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:32.950
Th-That's not it!

00:14:32.950 --> 00:14:35.450
Hey, it looks like another
pervert appeared.

00:14:35.450 --> 00:14:37.160
We should go after the vampiric bug first!

00:14:37.160 --> 00:14:42.420
Oh, my! What's with this vampiric bug?
It's covering my flowers!

00:14:42.420 --> 00:14:45.210
Stop! Don't pollinate me!

00:14:45.210 --> 00:14:48.050
What kind of situation is this?

00:14:48.050 --> 00:14:52.140
Completely naked with just flowers on
the crotch is a gallant and cool style...

00:14:52.140 --> 00:14:54.310
Wake up, idiot!

00:14:54.310 --> 00:14:57.640
That vampiric bug's powers
have gotten even stronger!

00:14:57.640 --> 00:15:00.850
There's no gender or species
distinction in the attraction!

00:15:03.480 --> 00:15:06.990
Oh, no! John...!

00:15:09.900 --> 00:15:11.570
This is...

00:15:11.570 --> 00:15:15.200
...such an intense power of attraction.

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:20.460
Oh... John...

00:15:20.460 --> 00:15:22.460
Lord John...

00:15:22.460 --> 00:15:26.420
The vampiric bug's power of
attraction raised to its highest limit

00:15:26.420 --> 00:15:30.680
and John's natural attraction
are resonating with each other...

00:15:32.140 --> 00:15:35.180
Sand...

00:15:39.680 --> 00:15:45.730
Lord John... Lord John... Lord John...

00:15:47.030 --> 00:15:50.320
The day of promise has come...

00:15:50.320 --> 00:15:56.280
The time has come for all humanity
to receive salvation and "nu."

00:15:56.280 --> 00:15:59.910
Now, everyone. Let us pray...

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:04.130
Nunen.

00:16:07.710 --> 00:16:11.510
Hm... It calmed down
after getting full, huh?

00:16:11.510 --> 00:16:15.180
I got some good data, fools.

00:16:15.180 --> 00:16:16.050
All's well that ends well!

00:16:16.050 --> 00:16:18.260
All's <i>not </i>well!

00:16:18.260 --> 00:16:20.180
Nunen.

00:16:21.980 --> 00:16:23.520
"Draluc's All Night Shin-Yoko"

00:16:23.520 --> 00:16:26.150
"Draluc's All Night Shin-Yoko"

00:16:23.520 --> 00:16:26.150
All Night Shin-Yoko!

00:16:26.150 --> 00:16:27.400
"Ronaldo Vampire Hunter Agency"

00:16:28.320 --> 00:16:32.240
Now, tonight's All Night
Shin-Yoko has begun!

00:16:32.240 --> 00:16:34.610
It will be brought to you by
the handsome vampire, Draluc,

00:16:34.610 --> 00:16:39.910
and the embodiment of "round,"
the armadillo, John!

00:16:39.910 --> 00:16:42.790
Now, let's start by reading
some listener mail.

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:46.880
Our first letter is from "Dral,"
who lives in Shin-Yokohama.

00:16:46.880 --> 00:16:50.630
The celery I got from Handa
has turned vampiric.

00:16:50.630 --> 00:16:52.340
What should I do?

00:16:53.300 --> 00:16:58.850
Sorry to hear that! Let's ask those
in the studio for their ideas, too.

00:16:58.850 --> 00:17:04.190
Ronaldo in the studio, what do you think
we should do about vampiric vegetables?

00:17:04.190 --> 00:17:08.690
Huh? I don't know.
Do whatever you want, moron.

00:17:08.690 --> 00:17:09.980
Toss!

00:17:12.490 --> 00:17:15.700
We'll take a trip outside the studio!

00:17:15.700 --> 00:17:18.530
All Night Shin-Yoko.

00:17:18.530 --> 00:17:21.950
The next segment is
"Please Tell Me, Hunter!"

00:17:21.950 --> 00:17:25.250
so I've come to the Hunters Guild!

00:17:25.250 --> 00:17:26.210
Welcome.

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:27.210
What's going on?

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:32.670
In this segment, I'd like to ask the
hunters everyday questions frankly!

00:17:32.670 --> 00:17:35.340
Looks like you've got a lot of
free time again, huh, Draluc?

00:17:35.340 --> 00:17:40.310
First, let's talk to Shin-Yokohama's
sea-anemone-hair guy, Shot.

00:17:40.310 --> 00:17:45.440
Shot, you like hairy girls, right?
What kind of hairiness turns you on?

00:17:45.440 --> 00:17:47.400
Don't you have other
things you could ask?!

00:17:47.400 --> 00:17:49.690
Other things? Like what?

00:17:49.690 --> 00:17:54.530
Huh? Well, everyone's
interested in me, right?

00:17:54.530 --> 00:17:58.200
So like, "Why is Shot
so cool?" or something...

00:17:58.200 --> 00:18:01.790
Next, we have Shin-Yokohama's
flea-hearted arm guy.

00:18:01.790 --> 00:18:05.620
H-Hey, wait! I'll think of
something better! Okay?

00:18:05.620 --> 00:18:08.290
Like, "What's the theme
of Shot's costume?"

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:10.840
Or like, "The hook shots
under his sleeves"--

00:18:10.840 --> 00:18:13.800
Hey, look over here! Damn it...

00:18:13.800 --> 00:18:15.220
J-John!

00:18:15.220 --> 00:18:18.760
I love it when girls accidentally miss
a spot when shaving their pits!

00:18:19.720 --> 00:18:21.680
That's just gross.

00:18:23.810 --> 00:18:26.890
All Night Shin-Yoko.

00:18:30.900 --> 00:18:36.360
Now, our next target is the duck who's
always there on the edge of the screen!

00:18:36.360 --> 00:18:39.860
I've always wondered--
why do you wear a duck costume?

00:18:39.860 --> 00:18:43.160
Hey, don't ask Mr. Vamone
something so rude.

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:46.330
Yeah, Mr. Vamone's an amazing person!

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:48.000
He's partial to wearing a duck costume,

00:18:48.000 --> 00:18:51.710
but he's an experienced hunter who
has defeated all kinds of vampires.

00:18:52.590 --> 00:18:56.380
The slashes he sends out with his special
long sword "Leek" are incredible!

00:18:56.380 --> 00:18:58.510
He's eliminated the most
vampires in Shin-Yoko

00:18:58.510 --> 00:19:00.890
and is super popular
with people of all ages!

00:19:00.890 --> 00:19:03.350
What does "partial to wearing
a duck costume" mean?

00:19:03.350 --> 00:19:06.350
The one who took Ronaldo on
as an apprentice and trained him

00:19:06.350 --> 00:19:08.020
was also Mr. Vamone.

00:19:08.020 --> 00:19:10.770
What does "partial to wearing
a duck costume" mean?

00:19:10.770 --> 00:19:14.270
He was also my comrade-in-arms
who stood on the front lines with me

00:19:14.270 --> 00:19:16.190
when I was still on active duty.

00:19:16.190 --> 00:19:18.650
What does "partial to wearing
a duck costume" mean?

00:19:18.650 --> 00:19:20.240
♪ Vamone, Vamone ♪

00:19:20.240 --> 00:19:21.780
♪ Vamone, Vamone ♪

00:19:21.780 --> 00:19:23.580
♪ Vamone, Vamone ♪

00:19:23.580 --> 00:19:28.040
♪ Mr. Vamone ♪

00:19:28.040 --> 00:19:31.210
♪ Vamone, Vamone, Mr. Vamone ♪

00:19:31.210 --> 00:19:34.250
♪ Mr. Vamone of Shin-Yokohama ♪

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:37.380
♪ Vamone, Vamone, Mr. Vamone ♪

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:40.510
♪ Dependable hunter, Mr. Vamone ♪

00:19:40.510 --> 00:19:43.850
♪ Vamone, Vamone, Mr. Vamone ♪

00:19:43.850 --> 00:19:46.770
♪ He'll defeat the bad vampires ♪

00:19:46.770 --> 00:19:50.020
♪ Tremble and sleep, villains ♪

00:19:50.020 --> 00:19:53.100
♪ Next time, it might be your turn ♪

00:19:53.100 --> 00:19:55.900
Apparently, he created this
dance for PR as a hobby.

00:19:55.900 --> 00:19:58.490
He really is partial to it, huh?

00:19:58.490 --> 00:20:02.360
Well, a hunter's costume is really just an
amalgamation of what we're partial to...

00:20:02.360 --> 00:20:05.200
So you're just partial to that shirt
that looks like a bra hook?

00:20:05.200 --> 00:20:07.700
Oh, yeah, I also thought that was a bra.

00:20:07.700 --> 00:20:09.120
What?!

00:20:09.120 --> 00:20:11.790
All Night Shin-Yoko!

00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:19.710
Now, let's take this chance
to ask all of our questions!

00:20:20.630 --> 00:20:24.390
Maria, why do you wear a nun's habit,
even though you work as a hunter?

00:20:24.390 --> 00:20:26.760
It's because if I wear a hunting
vest and carry a hunting gun,

00:20:26.760 --> 00:20:28.600
then I won't look like a hunter.

00:20:28.600 --> 00:20:29.600
That's true.

00:20:29.600 --> 00:20:32.350
What about you, Homerun Batter?
Why do you wear those clothes?

00:20:32.350 --> 00:20:33.440
I'm partial to them!

00:20:33.440 --> 00:20:36.940
Um, what about you people who are sometimes
in the background...? Who are you?

00:20:36.940 --> 00:20:39.230
Your description is too heartless.

00:20:39.230 --> 00:20:42.860
"Inventor Hunter - Medoki"
I'm Medoki. I'm a hunter,
but I also work at a hunter goods shop.

00:20:42.860 --> 00:20:44.410
"Hunter - [Dispassionate Hunter] Shoka"
Wake up, Shoka!

00:20:44.410 --> 00:20:45.530
"Hunter - [Dispassionate Hunter] Shoka"
I'm sleepy...

00:20:45.530 --> 00:20:46.740
"Hunter - [Dispassionate Hunter] Shoka"
This is a new item! Vampire Garlic Spray!

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:50.160
Sand!

00:20:50.160 --> 00:20:51.710
Why do you wear those clothes?

00:20:51.710 --> 00:20:53.000
I'm partial to them!

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:54.370
Do you two want to try?

00:20:54.370 --> 00:20:57.460
Sand...!

00:20:57.460 --> 00:20:59.920
Ta Chan, are you partial
to your clothes, too?

00:20:59.920 --> 00:21:02.170
Oh, what about your clothes?
Are you partial to them, too?

00:21:02.170 --> 00:21:04.180
You should wear them
every day then, scrawny!

00:21:04.180 --> 00:21:05.300
Sand!

00:21:05.300 --> 00:21:06.220
--Are you partial to that bra, too?

00:21:06.220 --> 00:21:07.470
--Yes.
--Are you partial to that bra, too?

00:21:07.470 --> 00:21:09.600
I'm not partial to your face, though!

00:21:09.600 --> 00:21:10.890
Sand!

00:21:10.890 --> 00:21:11.730
A vampire!

00:21:11.730 --> 00:21:14.100
Why did you come in? Are you stupid?

00:21:15.600 --> 00:21:17.650
You're shameless,
coming into the guild like that!

00:21:17.650 --> 00:21:18.860
Surround the vampire!

00:21:18.860 --> 00:21:22.440
Damn it, I'll kill you!

00:21:22.440 --> 00:21:24.700
Let's go home, John.

00:21:25.660 --> 00:21:29.240
All Night Shin-Yoko.

00:21:30.290 --> 00:21:33.330
Oh, that was fun.

00:21:34.540 --> 00:21:39.590
Now, I hate to say this, but it's about
time for All Night Shin-Yoko to end.

00:21:39.590 --> 00:21:41.960
Let's meet again--

00:21:41.960 --> 00:21:43.550
Sand!

00:21:45.300 --> 00:21:49.850
...next time!

00:21:53.680 --> 00:21:56.640
"The world transforms"

00:21:56.850 --> 00:22:00.570
Leave this place to me, Ronaldo.

00:22:00.570 --> 00:22:02.940
I believe.

00:22:02.940 --> 00:22:04.780
I'll fight!

00:22:04.780 --> 00:22:06.700
Shot...

00:22:06.700 --> 00:22:08.870
He believed in me!

00:22:08.870 --> 00:22:12.740
Stand up! You call yourself a hunter?!

00:22:12.740 --> 00:22:16.210
The vampire dies in no time.
